how to create and run playwright tests 
--------------------------------------

npx playwright test 
npx playwright test .spec.js  run a specific file
npx playwright test .spec.js --project=chromium only for one specific browser 

npx playwright test .spec.js --project=chromium --headed

npx playwright test .spec.js --project=chromium --headed --debug   test step by step


